{"task_id": "HumanEval/50", "solution": "def decode_shift(s: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Decodes a string by shifting each character backward by 5 positions, wrapping around.\n    Non-lowercase alphabetic characters are returned as-is.\n    \"\"\"\n    decoded_chars = []\n    for ch in s:\n        if 'a' <= ch <= 'z':\n            char_pos = ord(ch) - ord('a')\n            decoded_pos = (char_pos - 5) % 26\n            decoded_chars.append(chr(decoded_pos + ord('a')))\n        else:\n            decoded_chars.append(ch)\n    return \"\".join(decoded_chars)"}
