{"task_id": "HumanEval/92", "solution": "def any_int(x, y, z):\n    '''\n    Returns True if all three numbers are integers AND one of the numbers\n    is equal to the sum of the other two. Otherwise, it returns False.\n    '''\n    # First, verify if all three inputs are integers.\n    if not (isinstance(x, int) and isinstance(y, int) and isinstance(z, int)):\n        return False\n\n    # If all are integers, check if one of the numbers is the sum of the other two.\n    if (x == y + z) or (y == x + z) or (z == x + y):\n        return True\n    else:\n        return False"}
